    "reusableOption": "ripgrep's library crates: ignore (gitignore-aware directory walker, 164M downloads) and grep-searcher / grep-regex (the fast line-regex engine, 13.6M downloads).",
    "biggestUnknown": "Whether you will accept depending on ripgrep's crates as the regex+gitignore foundation. If you insist on zero ripgrep dependency and reimplement the engine, the must-have becomes a multi-year performance chase against ripgrep with little likelihood of matching it."
